        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International AP-PH-6626, 12\" Traditional Fullerton Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAdd your own personal style to your appliances with the 12\" Fullerton Appliance Pull from RK International. It has traditional styling with a subtle raised detail that really brings out the highlights of the finishes especially on the Valencia Bronze finish and the Brushed English finish. The AP-PH-6626 12\" Traditional Fullerton Appliance Pull is available in 7 beautiful finishes, so you will be able to find exactly what you are looking for.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/traditional-fullerton-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-126\"><b>Matching Fullerton Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/fullerton-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-626\"><b>Matching Fullerton Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditional Fullerton Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator/appliance door panel.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
